lood - not to mention scale, feather, horn, and fang. Thanks to the \"Cultural Exchange Between Species Act,\" these once-mythical creatures have assimilated into society, or at least, they're trying.\n\nWhen a hapless human teenager named Kurusu Kimihito is inducted as a \"volunteer\" into the government exchange program, his world is turned upside down. A snake-like lamia named Miia comes to live with him, and it is Kurusu's job to take care of her and make sure she integrates into his everyday life.\n\nUnfortunately for Kurusu, Miia is undeniably sexy, and the law against interspecies breeding is very strict. Even worse, when a ravishing centaur girl and a flirtatious harpy move in, what's a full-blooded teenage human with raging hormones to do?!\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"},"tags":[{"name":"Monster Girl","rank":97,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Harem","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Slapstick","rank":91,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nudity","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":87,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":85,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban Fantasy","rank":81,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cohabitation","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Interspecies","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Centaur","rank":71,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Seinen","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":68,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Adult Cast","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Mermaid","rank":65,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Parody","rank":65,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Demons","rank":57,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Zombie","rank":55,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Dullahan","rank":54,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Chuunibyou","rank":54,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tanned Skin","rank":53,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tomboy","rank":40,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Monster Musume: Everyday Life With Monster Girls","english":"Monster Musume: Everyday Life With Monster Girls